# run-pass 期望输出例外：仅纳入已确认**平台无关**（无路径 / 时序 / PID / fd 号 /
# kqueue 等平台专属分支）的用例，供 CI 精确比对。
#
# 注意：不可放开为 `!tests/run-pass/*.out`——部分用例输出随平台变化，纳入会使
# ubuntu-latest 与 macos-latest 双平台 CI 失配。典型：`y2a_kqueue` /
# `y2b_kqueue_wait` 依赖 kqueue（macOS/BSD 专属，Linux 回退 poll 且 `kq < 0`，
# 输出 3 而非 5）。新用例加白名单前须确认两平台输出一致。
!tests/run-pass/dyn_self_return.out
!tests/run-pass/any_downcast.out
!tests/run-pass/agg_return_plain.out
!tests/run-pass/self_return_normal.out
!tests/run-pass/atomic_i64.out
!tests/run-pass/concurrent_counter.out
!tests/run-pass/tuple_destructure.out
!tests/run-pass/if_while_let.out
!tests/run-pass/match_guard_range_or.out
!tests/run-pass/drop_raii.out
!tests/run-pass/generic_where_clause.out
!tests/run-pass/generic_impl_multi.out
!tests/run-pass/arena-ir-traversal.out
!tests/run-pass/refcell.out
!tests/run-pass/hashset_setops.out
!tests/run-pass/hashset_iter.out
!tests/run-pass/hashset_ops_symbol.out
!tests/run-pass/hashset_cmp_symbol.out
